  "source_findings": [
    "5cda901 create_project.tcl selects gen_dc_protocol/dc_stmc_auto_lock/cc_rom_from_cc_tbl, whose absent R12 uses 2pRA2/RDD then SEND_RA2/PSHA.",
    "40530da selected Lauberhorn generator uses R12 -> 3pRA3/RDD then SEND_RA3/PEMD.",
    "SEND_F31 used FLDX_EH already at 7b5cc87; SEND_F21 uses SINV_H with zero dmask.",
    "THX legacy remote_fsm.txt admits LS -> IS_d; AE_d -> E; FE_d -> FA_d, without intervening software store. This abstract FSM does not model payload values or clean/dirty contents.",
    "RX router has no write completion path; data-bearing HAKD does not establish a software store."
